# Development only. Copy to frontend/.env to point the Vite dev server (5173) at the
# API on 8000. The production build ignores these defaults and uses same-origin paths
# (/upload, /documents, /health) plus a WebSocket derived from the current host, so
# FastAPI can serve the built bundle on its own.
#
# Do NOT set these for a production build (npm run build) — a hardcoded localhost here
# would break the single-server deployment behind ngrok or any other host.
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000
# VITE_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8000/ws/chat